        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-193757",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Accordingly, we have a dedicated IP and design support team that focuses on timely development of IP and processes specifically designed for our customers in order to ensure products that operate and perform as intended.",
        "start_character": 4424,
        "end_character": 4644
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-193757",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-193757-1bcd38472aa9a4ed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-193757",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As part of our wafer fabrication services, we also offer wafer probing services, which test, or probe, individual die on the processed wafers and identify dice that fail to meet required standards.",
        "start_character": 49888,
        "end_character": 50085
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-193757",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-193757-1bcd38472aa9a4ed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-193757",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Based on the need to produce secure products like smart card ICs, we introduced ISO15408 (CC, Common Criteria) certification specifically designed for secure production procedures not only in data receiving, processing and destruction but also higher physical access control request for the purpose of securing entire production line.",
        "start_character": 61029,
        "end_character": 61363
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-193757",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-193757-1bcd38472aa9a4ed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-193757",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "By continuously enhancing our IP offerings, reference design procedures and design services through collaboration with major vendors, we aim to provide complete, accurate and user-friendly design solutions to our customers.",
        "start_character": 53865,
        "end_character": 54088
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-193757",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-193757-1bcd38472aa9a4ed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-193757",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Furthermore, we believe we can provide more cost-effective services by focusing our research and development expenditures on the specific requirements of our customers.",
        "start_character": 15671,
        "end_character": 15839
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-193757",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-193757-1bcd38472aa9a4ed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-193757",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Furthermore, we have successfully developed specialty technologies such as 55/40/28/22nm embedded memory for MCU and automotive products.",
        "start_character": 33107,
        "end_character": 33244
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-193757",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-193757-1bcd38472aa9a4ed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-193757",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we have established a data-driven advanced semiconductor smart manufacturing system to provide world-class quality production, ensure information security and service quality, as well as improve customer satisfaction, operational and R&D efficiency.",
        "start_character": 55694,
        "end_character": 55956
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-193757",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-193757-1bcd38472aa9a4ed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-193757",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Persistent and proactive carbon emission reduction: Through continually developing advanced foundry process technologies, enhancing productivity and improving energy efficiency, we are able to minimize carbon emissions in both manufacturing stage of wafers and using stage of IC end products.",
        "start_character": 79661,
        "end_character": 79953
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-193757",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-193757-1bcd38472aa9a4ed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-193757",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To maintain a leading position in the foundry business, we have placed great emphasis on achieving and maintaining a high standard of manufacturing quality.",
        "start_character": 23008,
        "end_character": 23164
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-193757",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-193757-1bcd38472aa9a4ed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-193757",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To maintain and enhance our position as a market leader, we have adopted a business strategy that focuses on a partnership-driven business model designed to accommodate our customers’ business needs and objectives and to promote their interests as our partners.",
        "start_character": 12255,
        "end_character": 12516
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-193757",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-193757-1bcd38472aa9a4ed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-193757",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To optimize fabrication services for our customers, we work closely with them as they finalize circuit design and contract for the preparation of masks to be used in the manufacturing process.",
        "start_character": 46411,
        "end_character": 46603
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001193125-26-193757",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001193125-26-193757-1bcd38472aa9a4ed",
        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-193757",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer our customers turnkey solutions by providing subcontracted assembly and test services.",
        "start_character": 46604,
        "end_character": 46704
      }
    ]
